  "state": "OPEN",
  "statement": "The low-temperature limit is stated as $|{\\rm STAB}(\\psi)|/2$ in Sec. III B and, in the supplemental material, derived as $\\tfrac12|{\\rm STAB}(\\psi)|$; Sec. VI C states it as $|{\\rm Stab}(\\psi)|$ without the factor. The Sec. VI C form is the one that disagrees with the derivation.",
